            "review_title": "Review at Luxury",
            "review_text": "JuliaAndNico2015\nMunich, Germany2 contributions\n0\nWorst food, worst service ever ever ever\nFeb 2015 • Couples\nWe went to this place for a little snack, but soon realized that \"luxury cafe\" is surely just a joke!\n\nWe ordered french fries and a yoghurt-cup with fresh mango (as shown in the pictures in the menu).\n\nAfter some waiting, we received first the dirtiest french fries, we have ever seen in our lives. The fries wreaked of oil, which had innumerable black dirt particles in it. They were served on a piece of paper, probably for the oil. \nWe could't eat the french fries.\n\nThen we received, what should have been the yoghurt-cup. It was a yoghurt-shake at best. They had mixed the yoghurt with ice and mango together. (We ordered beer and juice as well, so a shake would clearly make no sense).\nWe went downstairs only to find\nthe extremely uncooperative staff, which did not understand that we would like to get what we ordered.\n\nThey said that they are sorry and that they can make another one, but charge double. Or take that shake back, and still charge us for it.\nAfter some minutes of arguing, they agreed to change it, free of charge. It only took some more minutes of arguing, to tell the non-english speaking staff and cook that we would like to receive the yoghurt cup, they printed on the menu. Or at least some kind of yoghurt.\n\nAfter more waiting, we received a milkshake-glass filled with weird-tasting yoghurt, mango-pieces and ice-cubes. Yuk!\n\nThe worst of this lunch was certainly not the bad yoghurt, and not even the disgusting french fries, but the totally unacceptable reaction of the staff.\nRead more\nWritten March 19, 2015",
